{"reviewId": "363182609_84J4unycK", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 18, "content": "当全球运行至萧条期，时局动荡，经济衰退，美元贬值，地缘冲突，央行购金，人民币走向国际化争夺黄金定价权，是否代表黄金会一定时期内处于高位震荡？是否世界格局不再是美国称霸，而是我国不再畏惧列强？美元信用的坍塌，人民币的崛起，不仅意味着世界多级格局的产生，也意味着中国从遵守规则的任人摆布到制定规则的从容应对。", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "系出现大幅动荡时，黄金的定价机制才会发生根本性变化，此时黄金价格将在货币信用对冲属性的释放下迎来超级行情。", "range": "9808-9861", "chapterName": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "chapterIdx": 18, "reviewId": "363182609_84J4unycK", "userVid": 363182609, "topics": [], "createTime": 1763367427, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "author": {"userVid": 363182609, "name": "       ", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0019-rbxn9E6mTegMEgduo2tQe10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M8-202411-40", "desc": "每月阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读月", "levelIndex": 40}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 4, "likes": [{"userVid": 917613160, "name": "木子（宠物零食）", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/YwC28grHrhUC2Jl7tgxbfwfSicj7fzemqFJAI0zcoMQF9EqIzCf8GpJ77ounwLp7KvEgzSyxTTHAEOQT26CiaLXNXzp82BJgQq7icAtEBLgsrs/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "但这需要时间啊！不是短期能解决的。这是不是说黄金价格，会继续上扬？", "reviewId": "363182609_84J4unycK", "commentId": "363182609_84J4unycK_c204366970_86h7YjyLb", "userVid": 204366970, "createTime": 1768823441, "author"